{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>CiRxadian 是一款以晝夜節律為核心的追蹤工具，適合需要定時服藥、記錄日常習慣並改善睡眠質素的使用者。它透過智能提醒、活動記錄與睡眠分析，協助你掌握用藥時間與作息規律。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>主要功能</h2>\n<p>CiRxadian 整合藥物補充品追蹤、晝夜節律習慣記錄與 Apple Health 睡眠數據，具備可自訂的智能提醒，並以 Circadian Correlation Engine 分析咖啡因攝取、運動強度及壓力水平如何影響睡眠質素。你可記錄夜間驚醒原因，亦可輸出臨床摘要 PDF，方便覆診時與醫護人員分享。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-772-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-773-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-774-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-775-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-776-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：CiRxadian</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-13T00:50:18.001974+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":318,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}